RawQueries.ql is superseded by NativeSql.ql in this wave.

Rule id migration for any downstream consumer:
  raw_queries__query  +  query_kind="native"  ->  sql__data_query_native
  raw_queries__query  +  query_kind="jpql"    ->  sql__data_query_jpql

NativeSql.ql additionally emits:
  sql__named_native_query   (JPA @NamedNativeQuery, incl. repeatable containers)
  sql__named_jpql_query     (JPA @NamedQuery)
  sql__jdbc_call            (JdbcTemplate / NamedParameterJdbcTemplate / EntityManager)

On ocs-api-service that is 198 -> ~250 SQL-bearing sites, plus schema_refs and
uses_json columns that RawQueries did not produce.

Delete this file once the harness config has been repointed.
